		"hu": {
			"subject": "Szabadságkérelmed: {{statusLabel}}",
			"html": "<!DOCTYPE html>\n<html>\n<head>\n\t<meta charset=\"utf-8\">\n\t<meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0\">\n\t<title>Szabadságkérelem {{statusLabel}}</title>\n</head>\n<body style=\"margin: 0; padding: 0; font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, 'Segoe UI', Roboto, sans-serif; background-color: #f4f4f5;\">\n\t<table role=\"presentation\" width=\"100%\" cellspacing=\"0\" cellpadding=\"0\" border=\"0\" style=\"background-color: #f4f4f5;\">\n\t\t<tr>\n\t\t\t<td align=\"center\" style=\"padding: 48px 24px;\">\n\t\t\t\t<table role=\"presentation\" width=\"100%\" cellspacing=\"0\" cellpadding=\"0\" border=\"0\" style=\"max-width: 520px; background-color: #ffffff; border-radius: 8px;\">\n\t\t\t\t\t<tr>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<td align=\"center\" style=\"padding: 32px 32px 24px;\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<span style=\"font-size: 24px; font-weight: 700; color: #3b82f6;\">{{appNameHtml}}</span>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t</td>\n\t\t\t\t\t</tr>\n\t\t\t\t\t<tr>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<td style=\"padding: 0 32px 24px;\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<h1 style=\"margin: 0 0 16px; font-size: 20px; font-weight: 600; color: #18181b; text-align: center;\">A szabadságkérelmedet {{statusSentence}}</h1>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<p style=\"margin: 0 0 16px; font-size: 14px; line-height: 1.6; color: #52525b;\">Kedves {{recipientNameHtml}}!</p>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<p style=\"margin: 0 0 24px; font-size: 14px; line-height: 1.6; color: #52525b;\">A(z) <strong>{{organizationNameHtml}}</strong> szervezetben beadott szabadságkérelmedet elbírálták. Ha kérdésed van, keresd a HR-t.</p>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<table role=\"presentation\" width=\"100%\" cellspacing=\"0\" cellpadding=\"0\" border=\"0\" style=\"background-color: #f9fafb; border-radius: 6px; margin-bottom: 24px;\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<tr>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<td style=\"padding: 16px 20px;\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<p style=\"margin: 0 0 8px; font-size: 12px; font-weight: 600; color: #52525b; text-transform: uppercase; letter-spacing: 0.05em;\">A kérelem adatai</p>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<p style=\"margin: 0 0 4px; font-size: 14px; color: #18181b;\"><strong>Állapot:</strong> <span style=\"display: inline-block; padding: 2px 10px; border-radius: 999px; background-color: {{statusColor}}; color: #ffffff; font-size: 13px; font-weight: 600;\">{{statusLabel}}</span></p>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<p style=\"margin: 0 0 4px; font-size: 14px; color: #18181b;\"><strong>Típus:</strong> {{leaveTypeLabel}}</p>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<p style=\"margin: 0 0 4px; font-size: 14px; color: #18181b;\"><strong>Időszak:</strong> {{period}}</p>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<p style=\"margin: 0 0 4px; font-size: 14px; color: #18181b;\"><strong>Munkanapok:</strong> {{days}}</p>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t</td>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t</tr>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t</table>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<table role=\"presentation\" width=\"100%\" cellspacing=\"0\" cellpadding=\"0\" border=\"0\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<tr>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<td align=\"center\" style=\"padding: 0 0 8px;\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<a href=\"{{appUrl}}/admin?app=racona-work&amp;entry=leave\" style=\"display: inline-block; padding: 12px 24px; background-color: #3b82f6; color: #ffffff; text-decoration: none; border-radius: 6px; font-weight: 500; font-size: 14px;\">Szabadságaim megnyitása</a>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t</td>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t</tr>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t</table>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t</td>\n\t\t\t\t\t</tr>\n\t\t\t\t\t<tr>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<td style=\"padding: 24px 32px; border-top: 1px solid #e4e4e7;\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<p style=\"margin: 0; font-size: 12px; color: #a1a1aa; text-align: center;\">Ezt az emailt azért kaptad, mert a(z) {{appName}} rendszerben rögzített szabadságkérelmed állapota megváltozott.</p>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t</td>\n\t\t\t\t\t</tr>\n\t\t\t\t</table>\n\t\t\t</td>\n\t\t</tr>\n\t</table>\n</body>\n</html>",
			"text": "Kedves {{recipientName}}!\n\nA szabadságkérelmedet {{statusSentence}} a(z) {{organizationName}} szervezetben. Ha kérdésed van, keresd a HR-t.\n\nA kérelem adatai:\n  Állapot: {{statusLabel}}\n  Típus: {{leaveTypeLabel}}\n  Időszak: {{period}}\n  Munkanapok: {{days}}\n\nA szabadságaidat itt éred el: {{appUrl}}/admin?app=racona-work&entry=leave\n\nEzt az emailt azért kaptad, mert a(z) {{appName}} rendszerben rögzített szabadságkérelmed állapota megváltozott.\n\n{{appName}}"
		},
		"en": {
			"subject": "Your leave request: {{statusLabel}}",
			"html": "<!DOCTYPE html>\n<html>\n<head>\n\t<meta charset=\"utf-8\">\n\t<meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0\">\n\t<title>Leave request {{statusLabel}}</title>\n</head>\n<body style=\"margin: 0; padding: 0; font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, 'Segoe UI', Roboto, sans-serif; background-color: #f4f4f5;\">\n\t<table role=\"presentation\" width=\"100%\" cellspacing=\"0\" cellpadding=\"0\" border=\"0\" style=\"background-color: #f4f4f5;\">\n\t\t<tr>\n\t\t\t<td align=\"center\" style=\"padding: 48px 24px;\">\n\t\t\t\t<table role=\"presentation\" width=\"100%\" cellspacing=\"0\" cellpadding=\"0\" border=\"0\" style=\"max-width: 520px; background-color: #ffffff; border-radius: 8px;\">\n\t\t\t\t\t<tr>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<td align=\"center\" style=\"padding: 32px 32px 24px;\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<span style=\"font-size: 24px; font-weight: 700; color: #3b82f6;\">{{appNameHtml}}</span>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t</td>\n\t\t\t\t\t</tr>\n\t\t\t\t\t<tr>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<td style=\"padding: 0 32px 24px;\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<h1 style=\"margin: 0 0 16px; font-size: 20px; font-weight: 600; color: #18181b; text-align: center;\">Your leave request {{statusSentence}}</h1>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<p style=\"margin: 0 0 16px; font-size: 14px; line-height: 1.6; color: #52525b;\">Dear {{recipientNameHtml}},</p>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<p style=\"margin: 0 0 24px; font-size: 14px; line-height: 1.6; color: #52525b;\">The status of your leave request in the <strong>{{organizationNameHtml}}</strong> organization has changed.</p>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<table role=\"presentation\" width=\"100%\" cellspacing=\"0\" cellpadding=\"0\" border=\"0\" style=\"background-color: #f9fafb; border-radius: 6px; margin-bottom: 24px;\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<tr>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<td style=\"padding: 16px 20px;\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<p style=\"margin: 0 0 8px; font-size: 12px; font-weight: 600; color: #52525b; text-transform: uppercase; letter-spacing: 0.05em;\">Request details</p>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<p style=\"margin: 0 0 4px; font-size: 14px; color: #18181b;\"><strong>Status:</strong> <span style=\"display: inline-block; padding: 2px 10px; border-radius: 999px; background-color: {{statusColor}}; color: #ffffff; font-size: 13px; font-weight: 600;\">{{statusLabel}}</span></p>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<p style=\"margin: 0 0 4px; font-size: 14px; color: #18181b;\"><strong>Type:</strong> {{leaveTypeLabel}}</p>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<p style=\"margin: 0 0 4px; font-size: 14px; color: #18181b;\"><strong>Period:</strong> {{period}}</p>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<p style=\"margin: 0 0 4px; font-size: 14px; color: #18181b;\"><strong>Working days:</strong> {{days}}</p>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t</td>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t</tr>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t</table>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<table role=\"presentation\" width=\"100%\" cellspacing=\"0\" cellpadding=\"0\" border=\"0\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<tr>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<td align=\"center\" style=\"padding: 0 0 8px;\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<a href=\"{{appUrl}}/admin?app=racona-work&amp;entry=leave\" style=\"display: inline-block; padding: 12px 24px; background-color: #3b82f6; color: #ffffff; text-decoration: none; border-radius: 6px; font-weight: 500; font-size: 14px;\">Open my leave</a>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t</td>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t</tr>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t</table>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t</td>\n\t\t\t\t\t</tr>\n\t\t\t\t\t<tr>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<td style=\"padding: 24px 32px; border-top: 1px solid #e4e4e7;\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<p style=\"margin: 0; font-size: 12px; color: #a1a1aa; text-align: center;\">You received this email because the status of your leave request in {{appName}} has changed.</p>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t</td>\n\t\t\t\t\t</tr>\n\t\t\t\t</table>\n\t\t\t</td>\n\t\t</tr>\n\t</table>\n</body>\n</html>",
			"text": "Dear {{recipientName}},\n\nYour leave request in the {{organizationName}} organization {{statusSentence}}. If you have questions, contact HR.\n\nRequest details:\n  Status: {{statusLabel}}\n  Type: {{leaveTypeLabel}}\n  Period: {{period}}\n  Working days: {{days}}\n\nOpen your leave here: {{appUrl}}/admin?app=racona-work&entry=leave\n\nYou received this email because the status of your leave request in {{appName}} has changed.\n\n{{appName}}"
		}
	}
